        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "10e3b5a2-f8f6-3b3d-bcdd-fa9afeceada7",
                "word": "chiliasm",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "8de512f1-3eb9-413a-9cd5-b2df89afe18b",
                        "entry_id": "10e3b5a2-f8f6-3b3d-bcdd-fa9afeceada7",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chiliasms"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "219402b5-18a1-3a1b-8ce5-f5f3e79f81a0",
                        "entry_id": "10e3b5a2-f8f6-3b3d-bcdd-fa9afeceada7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Belief in an earthly thousand-year period of peace and prosperity, sometimes equated with the return of Jesus for that period."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "02eec599-7e52-4889-8e2b-60ef2108546b",
                                "sense_id": "219402b5-18a1-3a1b-8ce5-f5f3e79f81a0",
                                "text": "It was, however, in the Puritan movement in England, and in similar movements on the continent — especially the Bohemian Brethren — that chiliasm asserted its greatest vitality as an historical force."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbc4bbcf-aa91-47e3-b384-39a257b6bb18",
                                "sense_id": "219402b5-18a1-3a1b-8ce5-f5f3e79f81a0",
                                "text": "One of them, bureaucratic conservatism, represented the routinized sphere of administration, whereas the other, chiliasm, gave rise to the utopian consciousness and modern politics."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef13f14c-e415-4935-8d7c-0843830a6e28",
                                "sense_id": "219402b5-18a1-3a1b-8ce5-f5f3e79f81a0",
                                "text": "It is a known fact that Bolshevism has unmistakable characteristics of apocalyptic chiliasm, albeit misinterpreted in a physical, earthly way."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
